      WORD HEADS, ONE PER WORD: AN EMPTY1
      DESCRIBABLE LIST (HEAD CELL, LINK 1
      0) NAMED BY THE WORD SYMBOL. J11  1
      FILLS IN THE DESCRIPTION LIST     1
      DURING TRAINING.                  1
      HEAD OF ONCE                        T1      0     0
      HEAD OF UPON                        T2      0     0
      HEAD OF A                           T3      0     0
      HEAD OF MIDNIGHT                    T4      0     0
      HEAD OF DREARY                      T5      0     0
      HEAD OF WHILE                       T6      0     0
      HEAD OF I                           T7      0     0
      HEAD OF PONDERED                    T8      0     0
      HEAD OF WEAK                        T9      0     0
      HEAD OF AND                         T10     0     0
      HEAD OF WEARY                       T11     0     0
      HEAD OF OVER                        T12     0     0
      HEAD OF MANY                        T13     0     0
      HEAD OF QUAINT                      T14     0     0
      HEAD OF CURIOUS                     T15     0     0
      HEAD OF VOLUME                      T16     0     0
      HEAD OF OF                          T17     0     0
      HEAD OF FORGOTTEN                   T18     0     0
      HEAD OF LORE                        T19     0     0
      THE TEXT, AS A LIST OF WORD       1
      SYMBOLS, HEAD T39: ONCE UPON A    1
      MIDNIGHT DREARY WHILE I PONDERED  1
      WEAK AND WEARY OVER MANY A QUAINT 1
      AND CURIOUS VOLUME OF FORGOTTEN   1
      LORE                              1
